case        used: ref   zb
SAME boot            0     0   
SAME literal         5     5   A$="HELLO"
DIFF mid_kept        3     6   A$=MID$("ABCDEF",2,3)
SAME concat          4     4   A$="AB"+"CD"
SAME concat_var      6     6   A$="AB":B$=A$+"CD"
DIFF temp_print      0     3   PRINT MID$("XYZ",2)
DIFF temp_len        0     6   X=LEN(MID$("ABCDEF",2,3))
DIFF temp_two        3    10   X=LEN(MID$("ABCDEF",2,3)+"Q")

DIFF: 4/8
refcache: 0 hit, 2 miss, 2 stored
